@startuml itqan-act-01b-recite-and-results
' Itqan — Activity Diagram 01b: Recitation session, recite and results
' Built only from Itqan_Requirements.md: UC-10 flow steps 4-11 and its
' exceptions (§7.3), include UC-12 and extensions UC-11, UC-28 (§7.2);
' FR-12..FR-20, FR-26; BR-01, BR-02, BR-05, BR-14, BR-18; NFR-03.
' Continues from 01a at connector A.
<style>
root {
  FontName Helvetica
  FontSize 12
  FontColor #000000
  BackGroundColor #FFFFFF
  LineColor #000000
  LineThickness 0.75
  RoundCorner 0
  Shadowing 0
}

note { BackGroundColor #FFFFFF; LineColor #000000; FontColor #000000 }

activityDiagram {
  activity    { BackGroundColor #FFFFFF; LineColor #000000; FontColor #000000; RoundCorner 10 }
  diamond     { BackGroundColor #FFFFFF; LineColor #000000 }
  activityBar { BackGroundColor #000000; LineColor #000000 }
  arrow       { LineColor #000000; LineThickness 0.75 }
  swimlane    { LineColor #000000; LineThickness 0.75 }
}
</style>

|Quran Reader|
(A)
note left: From Activity Diagram 01a

repeat
  |Quran Reader|
  :Recite verse;
  |Itqan System|
  if (Pause detected?) then (yes)
    :Show next word as hint (UC-28);
  else (no)
  endif
  :Detect end of verse and analyse it;
  note left
    Runs while the reader
    recites the next verse (NFR-03)
  end note
  if (Analysis reliable?) then (yes)
    :Detect errors, link each to a word,
    highlight them (wording per mode);
  else (no)
    :Show "could not analyse" and
    exclude the verse from the score;
  endif
  if (Reader taps a highlighted
  or hinted word?) then (yes)
    :Play correct word audio (UC-11);
  else (no)
  endif
repeat while (More verses and session not ended?) is (yes) not (no)

:Calculate Mastery Score
on counted words (BR-01, BR-02);
note right
  Reached by every end reason:
  completed (last verse analysed),
  ended early (reader ends it), or
  interrupted (app closed, call,
  connection lost, logout).
end note
:Store session summary and mistakes,
discard audio and all other data (BR-05);
:Recalculate progress and streak;

|Quran Reader|
:View session results (UC-12);
stop

@enduml
